          {
            "kind": "shape-with-text",
            "id": "237:18195",
            "text": "CROSS-DOMAIN EXECUTION INHERITANCE — All detailed flows in this domain inherit: required foreground authority/dependency/preflight remains SYNC/HYBRID. After the owning domain commits an authoritative fact, independent cross-domain reactions use atomic outbox → TUN-FLOW-EXEC-02 Event Subscription Registry → per-subscription Event Delivery/Consumer Inbox. A subscriber failure cannot roll back the publisher or block unrelated subscribers. Redrive/replay preserves lineage and never implies a new external business side effect."
